	["The road east out of south-eastern Stonetalon comes down into the {zone:1413} at {area:1702}. {area:380} and {area:378} are Horde towns; {area:392} is a neutral port."] = "La route qui sort vers l'est du sud-est des Serres-Rocheuses descend dans {zone:1413} à {area:1702}. {area:380} et {area:378} sont des villes de la Horde ; {area:392} est un port neutre.",
